/*
  ScheduledExportsPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0262 · ScheduledExportsPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ScheduledExportsPanel` resolves (table "ScheduledExportsPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/system/pages/ScheduledExportsPanel.tsx). The second group is the form option
  catalog the web `<Select>` renders from the raw enum tokens (kept translatable here so the
  Swift sources hold no English literals). The third group backs the native chrome (the P4
  leaf freshness / loading / error copy + the VoiceOver-only labels).
*/

